  {
    "repo": "STM32CubeF3",
    "pr_number": 9,
    "title": "Fix documentation of I2C_WaitOnFlagUntilTimeout() to match code.",
    "state": "closed",
    "merged": true,
    "draft": false,
    "author": "markrages",
    "labels": [
      "enhancement",
      "internal bug tracker",
      "hal"
    ],
    "created_at": "2021-02-15T23:14:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-12-15T11:09:05Z",
    "closed_at": "2021-12-15T11:09:05Z",
    "merged_at": "2021-12-15T11:09:05Z",
    "body": "I ran into this code while trying to account for some 25 millisecond delays in my code.\r\n\r\nThe `I2C_WaitOnFlagUntilTimeout()` is improperly commented.  It is documented as if it waits for a flag to change _to_ the specified status,  but reading the code shows it is actually waiting for the flag to change _from_ the specified status.\r\n\r\nA quick grep shows the following duplicated functions are poorly documented in the same way:\r\n\r\n```\r\nSrc/stm32f3xx_hal_usart.c:static HAL_StatusTypeDef [USART_WaitOnFlagUntilTimeout();\r\nSrc/stm32f3xx_hal_irda.c:static HAL_StatusTypeDef IRDA_WaitOnFlagUntilTimeout()\r\nSrc/stm32f3xx_hal_smbus.c:static HAL_StatusTypeDef SMBUS_WaitOnFlagUntilTimeout();\r\nSrc/stm32f3xx_hal_smartcard.c:static HAL_StatusTypeDef SMARTCARD_WaitOnFlagUntilTimeout();\r\n```\r\nI did not make the corresponding fix to these functions.",
    "github_url": "https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/STM32CubeF3/pull/9",
    "head_ref": "docfix",
    "base_ref": "master",
    "merge_commit_sha": "64707c404c8448f9c7e562839471a051a9192b1e",
    "commits_count": 1,
    "review_comments_count": 0,
    "comments_count": 2,
    "changed_files_count": 1,
    "additions": 3,
    "deletions": 2,
    "linked_issue_numbers": [],
    "files_changed": [
      {
        "filename": "Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_i2c.c",
        "status": "modified",
        "additions": 3,
        "deletions": 2,
        "changes": 5,
        "previous_filename": null,
        "blob_url": "https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/STM32CubeF3/blob/a233db890e5838fec55eade963f841e4e8a0fe8b/Drivers%2FSTM32F3xx_HAL_Driver%2FSrc%2Fstm32f3xx_hal_i2c.c",
        "raw_url": "https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/STM32CubeF3/raw/a233db890e5838fec55eade963f841e4e8a0fe8b/Drivers%2FSTM32F3xx_HAL_Driver%2FSrc%2Fstm32f3xx_hal_i2c.c"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "repo": "STM32CubeF3",
    "pr_number": 8,
    "title": "Fix documentation of I2C_WaitOnFlagUntilTimeout() to match code.",
    "state": "closed",
