    "author": "markrages",
    "labels": [],
    "created_at": "2021-02-15T23:10:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-02-15T23:10:55Z",
    "closed_at": "2021-02-15T23:10:55Z",
    "merged_at": null,
    "body": "I ran into this code while trying to account for some 25 millisecond delays in my code.\r\n\r\nThe `I2C_WaitOnFlagUntilTimeout()` is improperly commented.  It is documented as if it waits for a flag to change _to_ the specified status,  but reading the code shows it is actually waiting for the flag to change _from_ the specified status.\r\n\r\nA quick grep shows the following duplicated functions are poorly documented in the same way:\r\n\r\n```\r\nSrc/stm32f3xx_hal_usart.c:static HAL_StatusTypeDef [USART_WaitOnFlagUntilTimeout();\r\nSrc/stm32f3xx_hal_irda.c:static HAL_StatusTypeDef IRDA_WaitOnFlagUntilTimeout()\r\nSrc/stm32f3xx_hal_smbus.c:static HAL_StatusTypeDef SMBUS_WaitOnFlagUntilTimeout();\r\nSrc/stm32f3xx_hal_smartcard.c:static HAL_StatusTypeDef SMARTCARD_WaitOnFlagUntilTimeout();\r\n```\r\n",
    "github_url": "https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/STM32CubeF3/pull/8",
    "head_ref": "docfix",
    "base_ref": "master",
    "merge_commit_sha": "d9eb671d3f2af5de59d573b8d9235c7f2c5a26f4",
    "commits_count": 1,
